WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.448
Welcome to Aura Remote, a product by AILoopLabs.

00:00:03.448 --> 00:00:08.692
Turn on your TV and connect your phone to the same trusted Wi-Fi network.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.094
Read the setup tips, then choose Search for TVs.

00:00:14.094 --> 00:00:16.702
This walkthrough uses example TV data.

00:00:16.702 --> 00:00:19.653
Follow the prompts for your own television.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:25.950
Choose your TV from the list and start its connection process.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.704
Check the name and brand.

00:00:27.704 --> 00:00:29.598
Demo TV is only an example.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:37.822
Depending on the brand, approve a TV prompt or enter its required code.

00:00:37.822 --> 00:00:39.731
Roku does not need a PIN.

00:00:39.731 --> 00:00:42.709
Wait for Aura to confirm authorization.

00:00:43.933 --> 00:00:49.977
After pairing is confirmed, name the TV, choose a room, and select Save and Open Remote.

00:00:49.977 --> 00:00:52.930
Your saved profile is stored on this phone.

00:00:54.733 --> 00:00:58.421
Use the directional arrows to move and OK to select.

00:00:58.421 --> 00:01:02.038
Scroll for Back, Home, volume and channel controls.

00:01:02.038 --> 00:01:04.663
Check the television for each result.

00:01:05.867 --> 00:01:08.557
Select Swipe Touchpad to use gestures.

00:01:08.557 --> 00:01:12.804
Swipe to navigate, tap to select, and double-tap to go back.

00:01:12.804 --> 00:01:15.423
Supported behavior depends on the TV.

00:01:16.667 --> 00:01:21.175
Movie Center contains search, playback, app, and input requests.

00:01:21.175 --> 00:01:23.922
Aura does not supply streaming content.

00:01:23.922 --> 00:01:27.374
Availability depends on your TV and its services.

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.328
Open the keyboard or microphone button to send text.

00:01:32.328 --> 00:01:33.619
Voice is optional.

00:01:33.619 --> 00:01:39.785
Read its explanation before allowing microphone access; typed input is also available.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:47.893
Use TVs and Setup to switch televisions, filter rooms, add devices, or remove a saved TV.

00:01:47.893 --> 00:01:52.541
Removing a device also clears its saved pairing credentials.

00:01:53.767 --> 00:01:56.721
Open Brand Guide for setup instructions.

00:01:56.721 --> 00:02:01.892
Native Android and Google TV pairing is not supported in this version.

00:02:01.892 --> 00:02:04.551
Controls vary by model and protocol.

00:02:05.767 --> 00:02:09.125
Use Privacy and Info for disclosures and notices.

00:02:09.125 --> 00:02:13.169
Visit the Aura website for the complete manual and support.

00:02:13.169 --> 00:02:16.390
You are ready to try the basic remote controls.

